{
  "about": "Good and bad request bodies for every form field. pytest checks them against the Pydantic models and Vitest against the zod schemas, so the two sets of rules can't drift apart (ARC-11). Each case starts from the form's base body and applies `set`. A value of {\"repeat\": \"x\", \"times\": 201} means that character repeated.",
